  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nSimplify: 4 ÷ 24 + 3.6 × (1)/(9) - { (1)/(15) + (1 - 1.5) }\n\n**Formula used:**\n\nUse BODMAS (Brackets, Order, Division/Multiplication, Addition/Subtraction).\n\n**Calculation:**\n\nExpression: 4 ÷ 24 + 3.6 × (1)/(9) - { (1)/(15) + (1 - 1.5) }\n\n⇒ 4 ÷ 24 = 1/6\n\n⇒ 3.6 × (1)/(9) = 3.6 ÷ 9 = 0.4\n\n⇒ (1)/(15) = 0.0667\n\n⇒ (1 - 1.5) = -0.5\n\n⇒ { (1)/(15) + (1 - 1.5) } = 0.0667 - 0.5 = -0.4333\n\n⇒ 1/6 + 0.4 - (-0.4333)\n\n⇒ 0.1667 + 0.4 + 0.4333 = 1\n\n**∴ The correct answer is option (4).**",
